{
  "id": "72",
  "title": "论八字撮要法",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“论八字撮要法”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "用之为官，不可伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-a8214e09c0a7d2e01d6f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "用之为财，不可劫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-c6f0d89904e47560c278-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "用之为印，不可破。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-7349951519874bd1ba2d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "用之食神，不可破。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-fd0383c4a9a957122807-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "用之为禄，不可冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-39019850d0e9ad90fb74-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若有七杀须要制，制伏太过反为凶；若遇伤官须要静，此是子平万法宗。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-baecb521b5d53acc0f8c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官最怕为官运。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-629f987ed89a8395a6d4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "在官九五見財星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-3dee0d60d5ee3abbea44-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬好杀，嫌财位。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-5af0440eff2c6fc7c31d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃怕冲，宜合迎。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-e5af2084cec60a244c2a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "比肩要逢七杀制。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-2aec1410a40b903ce21e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "七杀喜见食神刑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-b2d600762306e45362a9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有禄怕见官星到。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-2a249a6217986f2b3875-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神最喜偏财临。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-1ffdaa41710c413f6394-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "此是子平撮要法，江湖术者仔细明。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "72-2a5dd014976596995100-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
